  "content": ".\n├── synergy_config/\n│   ├── synergy_engine.py      # Core synergy merging logic (merges synergy with each file's attributes)\n│   ├── step_logic.yaml        # Config specifying which approach (hexad, tri-phase, spiral, etc.) + ordering rules\n│   ├── synergy_utils.py       # Optional utility code (priority scoring, fractal expansions, advanced merges)\n│   └── README.md              # Documentation on synergy steps, usage, best practices\n\n└── steps/\n    ├── 01_Potential/\n    │   ├── potential_seed.law       # Example: universal   seeds/laws\n    │   ├── baseline_energy.dyn      # Example: baseline dynamic attributes focusing on \"potential\"\n    │   └── README.md                # Brief step-level docs\n    ├── 02_Symmetry/\n    │   ├── symmetrical_constraints.reso\n    │   ├── harmony_rules.tune\n    │   └── README.md\n    ├── 03_Flow/\n    │   ├── expansion_logic.dyn\n    │   ├── real_time_transform.rule\n    │   └── README.md\n    ├── 04_Connectivity/\n    │   ├── bridging_module.rule\n    │   ├── cross_domain.style\n    │   └── README.md\n    ├── 05_Emergence/\n    │   ├── integrative_sheet.sheet\n    │   ├── synergy_design.design\n    │   └── README.md\n    └── 06_Recursion/\n        ├── feedback_loop.rule\n        ├── final_resoforms.reso\n        └── README.md",
